sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as 用户
  participant Web as Vue 前端
  participant Auth as Spring Boot AuthController
  participant Service as AuthService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Audit as 登录审计

  User->>Web: 输入租户、用户名、密码
  Web->>Auth: POST /api/auth/login
  Auth->>Service: login(request)
  Service->>DB: 查询 tenant / user / roles / permissions
  DB-->>Service: 用户与权限数据
  Service->>Service: PBKDF2 校验密码
  Service->>Service: 生成 HMAC token 和 session_hash
  Service->>DB: 写入 user_sessions
  Service->>Audit: 写 auth_login_events
  Service-->>Auth: LoginResponse
  Auth-->>Web: token + user + permissions
  Web->>Web: 保存 token 和菜单权限

  Web->>Auth: GET /api/auth/me
  Auth->>Service: validate token
  Service->>DB: 校验 session 未过期未注销
  DB-->>Service: session valid
  Service-->>Auth: 当前用户
  Auth-->>Web: user + permissions
